  idQuest: 666
  tenNhiemVu: "Ph\u1EE5c K\xEDch S\u01A1n T\u1EB7c Ph\u1ED1"
  loaiQuest: 0
  idQuaiCanDiet: 5
  soLuongBoXuongCanDiet: 550
  idDoiTuongCanGiaiCuu: 0
  soLuongCanGiaiCuu: 1
  loiThoaiNhanQuest: "\u0110\xE1m t\xE0 tu c\u01B0\u1EDBp b\xF3c t\u1EA1i Luy\u1EC7n
    Ng\u1EE5c \u0111\xE3 ho\xE0n to\xE0n hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF linh h\u1ED3n cho Ma Qu\xE2n!
    Ch\xFAng l\u1EADp c\xE1c th\xE1p canh qu\u1EF7, d\xF9ng n\u1ECF ma h\u1ECFa ph\u1EE5c
    k\xEDch t\xE0n s\xE1t nh\u1EEFng ai mu\u1ED1n ti\u1EBFp c\u1EADn phong \u1EA5n.
    H\xE3y san b\u1EB1ng c\xE1c \u0111i\u1EC3m ph\u1EE5c k\xEDch c\u1EE7a ch\xFAng"
  loiThoaiDangLam: "M\u0169i t\xEAn ma h\u1ECFa c\u1EE7a \u0111\xE1m t\xE0 tu ph\u1EE5c
    k\xEDch b\u1EAFn ra nh\u01B0 m\u01B0a! \u0110\u1EA1o h\u1EEFu h\xE3y di chuy\u1EC3n
    linh ho\u1EA1t, h\u1EA1 g\u1EE5c \u0111\u1EE7 \u0111\xE1m cung th\u1EE7 t\xE0
    \u0111\u1EA1o tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi b\u1ECB bao v\xE2y"
  loiThoaiHoanThanh: "C\xE1c tuy\u1EBFn th\xE1p canh qu\u1EF7 \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB
    \u0111\xE1nh s\u1EADp! S\u1EF1 t\xE0n b\u1EA1o c\u1EE7a \u0111\xE1m t\xE0 tu
    tay ch\xE2n \u0111\xE3 ph\u1EA3i tr\u1EA3 gi\xE1 \u0111\u1EAFt d\u01B0\u1EDBi
    tay \u0111\u1EA1o h\u1EEFu."
